OL,3,GNEWSACar park barrier fitted to curb
OL,4,Adriver behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lockable barrier has been installed
OL,7,Fat a car park in Hessle after reports
OL,8,Fof drivers meeting there, playing loud
OL,9,Fmusic and littering.
OL,11,FDrivers have been congregating in the
OL,12,Fmill car park on Hessle Foreshore in
OL,13,Fthe evenings, sounding their horns,
OL,14,Fplaying music and leaving rubbish
OL,15,Fbehind, East Riding of Yorkshire
OL,16,FCouncil said.
OL,18,FHumberside Police said a Public Space
OL,19,FProtection Order (PSPO) had been put in
OL,20,Fplace to reduce incidents of
OL,21,Fanti-social behaviour (ASB) in the
OL,22,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
